  "body": "Straight out of the pages of a House & Garden magazine, this beautifully renovated, single-level home is crisp, fresh, modern and genuinely inspiring. Clean architectural lines, new flooring throughout and a carefully considered contemporary aesthetic create a home that feels every bit as good as it looks. Light-filled and effortlessly stylish, it's the perfect blend of sophisticated design and relaxed coastal living. All of this just a three-minute flat stroll to Orewa Beach and your new local, the Orewa Beach Surf Club.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living area is the heart of the home, where a striking island bench, beautiful timber tones and seamless indoor-outdoor flow create an inviting space you'll love spending time in. Every detail feels considered, with a new HRV system, near-new roof, fresh paint and beautifully landscaped grounds allowing you to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the north-facing outdoor entertaining area. Quite simply, it's exceptional. Slide open the doors and step onto an incredibly private deck where oversized barn-style doors transform the space into a sheltered outdoor dining room, an entertainer's retreat or your very own yoga sanctuary. The outdoor fireplace adds another layer of atmosphere, whether you're cooking homemade pizzas, toasting marshmallows with the kids or enjoying the warmth of the fire over a glass of wine with friends.\r\n\r\nThe main bedroom enjoys its own private patio with a relaxed, Balinese-inspired feel. Imagine creating your own spa retreat, a peaceful space for meditation or yoga, or simply somewhere to enjoy your morning coffee. Two additional bedrooms and an exceptionally generous designer bathroom, complete with an oversized shower and separate bath, round out the home. Such is the size of the bathroom, there's even potential to explore reconfiguring the space into two bathrooms, should your needs require it.\r\n\r\nLife here is all about balance. Walk to the beach for a swim before work, paddleboard on the estuary, cycle the coastal paths or meet friends at one of Orewa's thriving cafés. Whether you're looking for a family home within walking distance of local schools, a stylish coastal retreat or your very own beach house, the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Orewa's most desirable streets, where just seven homes have sold in the past six years, opportunities to buy here are few and far between. Beautifully renovated, magazine-worthy and completely move-in ready, it's a refreshing departure from the ordinary. A home with style, personality, warmth and soul that simply feels incredible to come home to.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/IJZS",
